<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>roblox fisch shaker</Major>
    <Description>Turn the UI On! (Seriously, Do It)
This macro isn’t psychic. It needs the UI to be enabled, or it’s like trying to drive a car with no steering wheel—just not gonna happen.


Verified with the Latest Fisch Update
It’s been tested and works perfectly with the most recent Fisch patch (yes, that one). 
You can confidently run it without worrying that Fisch will randomly decide it’s outdated
.

Runs on Potatoes (But Not Tomatoes)
We’ve tested it on low-end systems (a.k.a. potato PCs), and it holds up just fine. But let’s be clear—if your "PC" is a tomato, or anything that struggles to open Notepad, this macro isn’t for you. 

Having Problems?
Drop a comment, and il help you out! Whether it’s an issue with your setup, a pesky bug, or just a classic case of “it works for everyone else but not me,” we’ve got you covered.


 this an improved discription. you can fix this macro to your liking very easly with a short tutorial! 
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
